<title>CHINA: SOCCER - RESULTS OF CHINA FOOTBALL ASSOCIATION CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER - RESULTS OF CHINA FOOTBALL ASSOCIATION CUP.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the results of</p>
<p>the first round first leg matches at the Chinese Football</p>
<p>Association Cup tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p> Shenzhen Jinpeng	2    Shanghai Yuyuan   1</p>
<p> Qingdao Hainiu	  3    Henan Jianye	2</p>
<p> Locomotive		0    August First	0</p>
<p> Vanguards Huandao     4    Shenzhen Ping'an  1</p>
<p> Foshan Fosidi	   1    Tianjin Samsung   1</p>
<p> Tianjin Wanke	   1    Guangzhou Apollo  1</p>
<p> Shenyang Haishi	 4    Wuhan Yaqi	  2</p>
<p> Liaoning		  1    Yanbian Aodong    0</p>
</text>
